catflow 0.8
1. Read Images           receipts/
2. <each read_receipt; on_error=skip>   [image] -> [text]
     1. OCR                  (input:1)
     2. Extract Structured               Qwen3 8B; "merchant, date, total,
                                         category"
     3. Table to Text                    format=csv
3. Join Text             separator="\n"
4. Text to Table         expected="merchant, date, total, category"
5. Query Table           group=category
6. Chart                 kind=bar; x=category; y=total
7. Save Image            spend.png
8. Table to Text   (4)   format=markdown
9. Save Text             expense-report.md
